data: {"id": "12e0e0f87c374a16-thinking-parallel_evidence-311", "run_id": "12e0e0f87c374a16", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 1.2 首轮结果分析与补证\n\n**首轮结论：**\n- **状态确认**：Pod 确实处于 `Pending` 状态，无 IP，未调度到任何节点（node: `<none>`）。\n- **根因定位**：`kubectl_events` 和 `kubectl_describe` 明确给出了 `FailedScheduling` 的具体原因：**3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector**。\n- **配置异常**：Pod 的 `Node-Selectors` 设置为 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。\n- **拓扑关系**：Pod 由 `ReplicaSet/workload-68c557d875` 管理，属于 `Deployment/workload`。\n\n**补证计划：**\n为了证实“节点不匹配”这一结论，我将查询当前集群的节点列表，并检查其 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 标签，确认是否有节点满足该选择器（即包含 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 的标签", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788408822533, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

