data: {"id": "12e0e0f87c374a16-thinking-parallel_evidence-1285", "run_id": "12e0e0f87c374a16", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我可以总结调查了：\n\n**事实与证据：**\n1. Pod `workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 处于 **Pending** 状态，从未被调度（node: <none>）。\n2. Pod 设置了 `Node-Selectors: aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。\n3. 集群中3个节点（master, node1, node2）均 **没有** `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签。\n4. 调度事件明确显示：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n5. 由于 Pod 从未运行，`kubectl_logs` 返回空（无输出），`query_pod_logs` 也因后端权限问题失败（与目标 Pod 无关）。\n\n**结论：**\n- **异常状态确认**：Pod 仍处于 **Pending** 状态，未恢复。\n- **根因**：PendingUnschedulable 的直接原因是 Pod 的节点选择器 `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788408841236, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

